cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this software or its outputs, please cite both the software and the associated paper.
title: >-
  Analysis pipeline for annual and perennial plant richness across Australia's
  rainfall gradient
abstract: >-
  A targets pipeline integrating GBIF occurrence records, AusTraits life-history
  classifications, Australian Plant Census taxonomy and WorldClim climate data to
  analyse how vascular plant species richness varies along Australia's rainfall
  gradient for native and introduced annuals and perennials.
type: software
license: MIT
